    "detailed_description": "Long after the last war, a knight must defend his home against an invading force and uncover a dark truth.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nProphet is a short, story driven souls-like experience created by a single developer. This game is just the prologue to a larger story that has yet to be told.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPrepare to step into a challenging realm that gracefully introduces newcomers to the Souls-like genre while offering seasoned players a brief yet unforgettable adventure. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nKey Features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-A short, intense, and story-driven Souls-like adventure.<br />\r\n-Immerse yourself in meticulously designed, atmospheric environments.<br />\r\n-Engage in challenging, strategic combat that rewards skill and adaptability.<br />\r\n-Unravel an enigmatic narrative and uncover hidden lore.<br />\r\n-Experience the passion of a solo developer dedicated to introducing you to the Souls-like genre.",
